  "label": "Venting anger is mapped onto homicidal rage",
  "description": "The text 'wanna kill her?' and 'there u go wit dat bs' is mapped onto the visual representation of the horror characters Freddy Krueger and Jason Voorhees, who are iconic symbols of homicidal rage and extreme violence. The meme equates the act of venting anger toward a white person with the homicidal intent these characters represent, using their visual presence to symbolize the supposed 'rage' of the venting person.",
